Put a workspace's changes into your project (and keep its commits as a branch)

Usage: forkspace merge [OPTIONS] [NAME]

Arguments:
  [NAME]  Workspace (defaults to the one you are in; with --undo: whose latest merge to undo)

Options:
      --undo  Put the project back as it was before the latest merge
      --list  With --undo, list the merges that can be undone
  -h, --help  Print help
